    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"chapter\" though. it feels permanent. like i've broken something that can't be fixed. they sacrificed so much so i could be this \"success\" and now i'm just a reminder of how much was wasted. every time i see them i just think about how much easier their lives would be if i hadn't been such a burden and a disappointment.",
